; M_EmissiveRed — hostile variant. Same shader, hostile=1: the colour flips to
; red, the flow reverses and quantises into hard 9 Hz steps so it stops reading
; as data in transit and starts reading as something sweeping. Used for scan
; sweeps, purge alarms and the red-alert lighting state.


